sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Reader
  participant Quill
  participant Disk as The disk
  Reader ->>+ Quill: Open notes.md
  Quill ->>+ Disk: Read it
  Disk -->>- Quill: The bytes
  Note right of Quill: nothing is fetched
  loop every keystroke
    Quill ->> Quill: Lay the preview out
  end
  alt it parsed
    Quill -->>- Reader: The drawn page
  else it did not
    Quill --x Reader: The line it went wrong on
  end
